This crate embeds data derived from the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (CMUdict):
  source:  https://github.com/cmusphinx/cmudict
  commit:  74790861f652b15e4ac49015a90074ad62a27690
  file:    data/cmudict.dict (unmodified; sha256 81917843c7f44ce2b094ac63873c2c7a4cf802040792c455ba3ca406891c3d22)
  derived: the compact lexicon table built from it by build.rs, and data/oov.model, a letter-context model
           trained only on that file (g2p-tool train)
Binaries that ship this crate must reproduce the CMUdict notice below (also in LICENSE-CMUDICT).

espeak-ng (GPL-3.0-or-later) is NOT part of this crate: it is not a dependency, not linked and never shipped.
It is used only by the repository's farm test scripts (tools/, not in the published package), through the
piper-tts wheel, as an offline reference to tune the mapping rules.

